# SSH public keys of the Meltingplot administrators.
#
# Every key listed here can log in as the `meltingplot` account on every image
# built from this tree. The account has no password (SSH key authentication
# only, sudo without password), so a build without a key here produces an image
# nobody can reach over SSH. Raspberry Pi Connect remote shell still works.
#
# Public keys only. Never put a private key or an auth key in this repository -
# it is public.
#
# One key per line, e.g.
# ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3Nza... tim@meltingplot.net
